  "cil_liability": true,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Proposed Flat 1, due to its poor layout, would not achieve an acceptable standard of accommodation, in terms of the excessively narrow and impractical kitchen resulting in a constrained living environment, and the poor outlook from the main kitchen window due to its proximity to the proposed refuse and recycling store. Furthermore, the flats would not achieve an acceptable standard of accommodation, due to substandard floor-to-ceiling heights resulting in a poor sense of space, reduced natural ventilation and an increased risk of overheating. Therefore, the proposed development is contrary to Policy D6 of the London Plan 2021 and Policy DM10 of the Core Strategy 2012.",
    "Insufficient information has been submitted to demonstrate the proposed off-street car parking arrangement could support safe and efficient manouvring and parking of vehicles resulting in unacceptable impact on highway safety and function, contrary to Paragraph 116 of the National Planning Policy Framework 2024, Policy T6 of the London Plan 2021 and Policy DM10 of the Core Strategy 2012."
  ],
